Package: wuw
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: bash-completion, runit, socklog
Description: compact status view for runit and SysV services
 wuw (what's up with) displays service state, process information, resource
 use and recent logs in a compact systemd-style view. It supports native
 runit services and traditional SysV init scripts without requiring systemd.
